# This directory is the MkDocs Material `custom_dir` (see mkdocs.yml `theme.custom_dir`).
# It is intentionally empty: owlcompare overrides no Material theme partials
# (the spec's rule is "nothing structural is overridden"). The directory must
# exist for MkDocs to start, so this placeholder keeps it tracked in git.
# Drop a `main.html` (extending Material's base) here only if a future change
# genuinely needs a theme-level override.
